# game/script_0.rpy:401
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_a2d4b281:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}短暂的混战中，你趁着一片混乱，迅速冲垮了守军组织松散的防线。"

# game/script_0.rpy:403
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_4d49c14b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们原本想有序地向城墙方向退却，转眼便成了仓皇奔逃，你也随之冲入城中。"

# game/script_0.rpy:405
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_46d88a07:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而，城墙之内，局势迅速起了变化。"

# game/script_0.rpy:407
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_351ce13b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}冲在最前的骑士们——包括带头的王子——显然挡不住法国人的优势兵力，正被一步步逼回城门。"

# game/script_0.rpy:409
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_37af873d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们无疑亟需步兵增援，可冲过去接应他们，是极为凶险的举动。"

# game/script_0.rpy:411
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_1bbda156:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伯爵不愿见王子身陷险境，迅速召集了一批志愿者前去救援。"

# game/script_0.rpy:413
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_4ccc4d9b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}其余人奉命据守城门，为安全撤退保留退路。"

# game/script_0.rpy:415
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_3e38d272:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}愿随伯爵同行的只有身经百战的勇士；你若拒绝，恐怕也没人会感到意外……"

# game/script_0.rpy:417
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:419
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_cd101b64:

    "{cps=50}……更何况你在与民兵的交战中受了伤，早已筋疲力尽，如今连站稳都艰难。"

# game/script_0.rpy:420
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:421
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_7811722f:

    "{cps=50}这无疑是向伯爵、甚至王子本人建功邀功的好机会。然而，天平的另一端放着的，却是你的性命——此时是否该拿命去冒险，实在是个大问题。"

# game/script_0.rpy:422
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:426
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_8ed07750:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一股勇气与不知从何而来的豪情涌上心头，你决定加入这支前往救援王子与骑士们的队伍。"

# game/script_0.rpy:428
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_51823abf:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}许多同伴对你的选择大为惊讶。伯爵也对你的勇气刮目相看——这是自出征以来，他第一次注意到你。"

# game/script_0.rpy:430
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_3cca5d77:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（伯爵）提升了7点！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）提升了5点！"

# game/script_0.rpy:432
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:435
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_8bcbd3b7:

    "{cps=50}紧接着，又有数人相继加入队伍，显然不甘落于人后。"

# game/script_0.rpy:436
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:438
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_528a4919:

    "{cps=50}巴塞洛缪也在其中，他笑着摇头，说自己对你的鲁莽始终叹为观止。"

# game/script_0.rpy:439
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_cc80b1de:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过，念在你为他所做的一切，他已别无选择，只能追随你走到天涯海角。"

# game/script_0.rpy:441
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:444
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_1541a2e3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伯爵亲自拔剑，领你们穿过狭窄的街巷发起冲锋，直奔已被围困在附近广场上的王子一行。"

# game/script_0.rpy:446
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_94e884dd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一队装备精良的城防士兵拦住了去路，他们正试图合拢包围圈，将英格兰骑士困在当中。"

# game/script_0.rpy:448
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:454
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_8fa7afc4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}身为理智之人，你决定留在城门口。"

# game/script_0.rpy:456
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_2de6627a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伯爵一行及时赶到，总算没让法国人将王子彻底围死。"

# game/script_0.rpy:458
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_54bd6ca9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}众人合力杀出一条血路退回城门，随后你们迅速撤至最初的阵地。"

# game/script_0.rpy:460
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_4bde283f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}被击溃的守军并不急于追击，显然不愿冒险，只求维持现状。"

# game/script_0.rpy:462
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_4bc56467:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}退至安全距离喘息之余，你心中渐渐涌起一股自豪——自己刚刚挺过了第一场战斗。"

# game/script_0.rpy:464
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_eeac312a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}就在你缓过神、包扎伤口之际，英格兰军队的主力正逐渐抵达城下。"

# game/script_0.rpy:466
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_d1c54575:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}绵延数英里的人流、骑兵与辎重车纵队如无尽的长河自天边涌来，缓缓将城市四面合围。"

# game/script_0.rpy:468
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_31a2b977:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在幸存者中找到军士，问他接下来作何打算。"

# game/script_0.rpy:470
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_b44be548:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}而他只回答了一个词……"

# game/script_0.rpy:472
translate chinese fight1_1_intro_aca2f867:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}围城。"

