# game/script_0.rpy:2663
translate chinese fight2_7_intro_7425f2bb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他不知如何从人群中一眼锁定了你，提起你尚在受罚之身，命你第一个登城，并补充说，若事成，不仅赦免你的过错，还会分你双份战利品。"

# game/script_0.rpy:2665
translate chinese fight2_7_intro_b5545057:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你遵命行事。"

# game/script_0.rpy:2667
translate chinese fight2_7_intro_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:2670
translate chinese fight2_7_intro_6fa07d53:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伯爵鼓动士兵们莫要胆怯，许诺第一个登上城墙者可获双份战利品，另有他自掏腰包的赏金。{w}然而，纵使他如此慷慨，甘愿率先登城者依然寥寥……"

# game/script_0.rpy:2672
translate chinese fight2_7_intro_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:2674
translate chinese fight2_7_intro_194a9c4f:

    "{cps=50}伯爵正想找个能作表率之人，目光落在了你身上。"

# game/script_0.rpy:2675
translate chinese fight2_7_intro_6f42aa2f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他忆起你往日的功绩，称以你的本领与胆识，理应身先士卒，引领这场进攻。"

# game/script_0.rpy:2677
translate chinese fight2_7_intro_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:2682
translate chinese fight2_7_intro_896d5eaa:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你无视危险，也不愿辜负伯爵的期望，冲上前去，率先攀上其中一架攻城梯。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（伯爵）提升了5点！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）提升了5点！"

# game/script_0.rpy:2687
translate chinese money_has_no_smell_punishment_92d25015:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}头顶上巨石一块接一块地砸落，关于黄金与荣耀的念头瞬间从你脑中飞散。"

# game/script_0.rpy:2690
translate chinese money_has_no_smell_punishment_4c070db5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你躲过第一块，随即举盾护在身前，接下接连砸落的数块巨石。"

# game/script_0.rpy:2692
translate chinese money_has_no_smell_punishment_bb1f858e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不得不始终举盾护住自身，攀爬的速度也因此大大放缓。"

# game/script_0.rpy:2694
