# game/script_0.rpy:8888
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_fight_1fb3594b:

    "{cps=50}敌军阵型正在瓦解，这场战斗恐怕很快就要结束了。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8890
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_fight_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:8968
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_4d7c750a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}即便被打落马下、人数又处于绝对劣势，骑士们依然拼死顽抗，你们费了九牛二虎之力才将他们制服。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8970
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_f110b20e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}法国骑兵的冲锋终于被彻底遏止，可代价何其惨重……环顾四周，许多同伴已不见了踪影，脚下的土地横七竖八地躺满了尸体。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8972
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:8975
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_f0a88e06:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你认出了其中一具尸体——巴塞洛缪。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8977
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_5c09cb0f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}看来，这可怜人的不祥预感果然应验了。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8979
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_689079e0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}涌上心头的悲伤与空虚，还带来了另一个念头——这念头老套得很，却同样无法回避。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8981
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_b8e97959:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一切，都是你的错。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8983
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_57ed252a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}无论幸与不幸，你都无暇沉溺于哀恸——法国人再度发起了进攻。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8985
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_14779390:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一次，轮到步兵登场——他们排成密集队形，向前推进。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8987
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_02004b81:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}被骑兵冲散的英格兰弓箭手早已退向后方，留下你独自坚守阵地。"

# game/script_0.rpy:8989
translate chinese cambrai_final_battle_postfight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
