# game/script_0.rpy:21172
translate chinese lindisfarne_fight_2_3da147b3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你感到战局正在向不利的方向倾斜，便瞅准时机，夺路而逃。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德降低10点！{vspace=5}威望降低1点！"

# game/script_0.rpy:21176
translate chinese lindisfarne_fight_2_fcd9b462:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}罗杰和他的手下在身后骂骂咧咧、极尽嘲讽，但他们已没有力气追赶，你得以脱身。"

# game/script_0.rpy:21178
translate chinese lindisfarne_fight_2_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:21180
translate chinese lindisfarne_fight_2_52b82dca:

    "{cps=50}然而不幸的是，逃跑途中你弄丢了佩剑，它落入了坎特伯雷的人手中。"

# game/script_0.rpy:21181
translate chinese lindisfarne_fight_2_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:21201
translate chinese lindisfarne_fight_2_6d37d8f8:

    "{cps=50}你两手空空地回到了达特福德……"

# game/script_0.rpy:21202
translate chinese lindisfarne_fight_2_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_0.rpy:21207
